WEBVTT

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.040
"EPIDERMIS
300 μm"

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.920
"EPIDERMIS
300 μm"
Hello!

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.290
I've come to deliver
your oxygen and nutrients!

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:23.920
Boy, have I been waiting
for these! I'm starving!

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.040
"CELL"
Thank you for your patience! Here you go!

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.920
"FRAGILE"
"CONDENSED GAS"
"CELL"
Thank you for your patience! Here you go!

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.040
Thanks!

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.330
My pleasure!

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:34.080
It's so nice out today.
Maybe I'll have it right here on the porch.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:35.330
"METAL DETECTED"

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.790
"METAL DETECTED"
That's not good!

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.500
Harmful materials detected
near the epidermis!

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.880
"HISTAMINE HANDLING MANUAL"

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.000
Let's see.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.290
For this amount, I should turn
the dial to... about this much, right?

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.170
Time to dig in!

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:50.670
"FULL COURSE"

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.330
"FULL COURSE"
Harmful materials detected nearby.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.330
"FULL COURSE"
Now releasing histamines.

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:57.460
"FULL COURSE"
Huh? No way! Just like that?

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.880
Confirming histamine response.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.710
Now dilating blood vessels.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:09.750
Everything just got short-circuited!

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:14.920
The itch nerves got short-circuited! Itchy!

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:15.750
What's going on?

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.040
"WHITE BLOOD CELL"

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.080
"WHITE BLOOD CELL"
Where's the antigen?

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.250
"WHITE BLOOD CELL"

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.250
Wh-White Blood Cell! I-It's all right!

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.420
Achoo!

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.250
"EPISODE 3:
DENGUE FEVER"

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.960
"EPISODE 3:
DENGUE FEVER"
I take a little break,
and look what happens.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:02.580
I take a little break,
and look what happens.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:07.040
Not exactly a breeze,
reacting to each and every harmful material.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.210
Well, but it is my job, I guess.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.080
Mast Cell! Where's the antigen?

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.210
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:19.170
There doesn't seem to be one, White Blood Cell.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.750
Hey, stop dumping histamine so recklessly!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.920
It's such a huge pain in the butt
for us every time!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.500
H-Huh?

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:30.500
We were invaded by a harmful material,
so I responded! I did what I had to do!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.420
What do you mean, "harmful material"?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.920
You know you were just overreacting
to something trivial again!

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.000
Hey, hold up! Histamines
do play a crucial role, and...

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.580
Calm down, you guys!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.250
But...

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.830
...that's because it's my job.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:47.880
Your job, your job! When have you ever done
anything but make trouble for others?

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:51.790
All you do is create extra work for us,
you hysterical cell!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.420
Who are you calling a...

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.750
..."hysterical cell"?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.250
Mast Cell! Please calm down!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:07.250
Okay, fine! So, I'm a troublemaker
who only creates extra work for you!

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:09.750
All right, I'm not going to do jack now!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:14.290
Get out of here!
All of you, get out of my sight!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.210
That was one mind-blowing fight.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:25.750
Sure, it can be hard to get along,
since we each have our own roles, but...

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:31.210
S-Sorry! I had something on my mind
and wasn't looking where I was going.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:34.380
No, I'm the one who should apologize.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.420
Langerhans Cell.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:41.170
A type of Dendritic Cell
found in the epidermis.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:45.750
They mainly present bacteria, viruses and
other foreign substances to the immune system,

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.830
alerting the brain to any invasions.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.960
They also have a second
self-protection function,

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:54.880
shielding the skin from ultraviolet and dryness.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.830
But you must be careful,
my dear Red Blood Cell.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.500
We're close to the epidermis. There's no
telling when outside enemies might attack.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.540
R-Right, sir!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:09.670
That's right! I have to focus on my own work!

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.210
Wh-What's that?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.040
This sound...

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.500
What's that? A saw?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.620
Mosquito.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:27.000
A parasitic insect that sucks blood from humans,
sometimes serving as a medium

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.210
for malaria protozoa.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:38.170
Whoa! There's something in the air!
Stay away from here, everyone! It's dangerous!

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.620
H-Huh?

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.670
I'm getting sleepy.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.620
Wha... Wha...

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.500
Whaaaaat?

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.460
All the blood cells are being taken!

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.210
I-I'm about to be taken, too--

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.750
Hang in there, please!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.580
Here, take my hand!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.790
Ouch! Ugh...

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.170
They're gone.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.540
Wh-What just happened?

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:19.830
I wonder what this could be.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.540
A mask?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.210
I don't know where it came from,

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:30.420
but this mask seems to have
a mysterious allure.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.670
A-Are you okay?

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.120
De-Dengue!

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:55.880
Whoa! The wind!

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.120
De-Dengue!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.040
What's going on?

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:04.330
The Langerhans Cells
are acting crazy all of a sudden!

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:08.750
Don't tell me these guys
are virus-infected cells!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.330
"2k REALTY
ROOMS AVAILABLE
WHY NOT START A NEW LIFE?"
Somebody help us!

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:20.960
What's up with this extreme reaction?
I have to release histamines!

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.210
Stop dumping histamine so recklessly!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.420
You hysterical cell!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.330
I-It doesn't matter.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:31.080
I just have to do my job.

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.040
It would just be...

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.080
...extra work, right?

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.330
That's right.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:45.670
Even if I don't release histamines now,
someone will eventually show up.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.000
Are those the cells from before?

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.790
In my eyes,

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:02.170
you appear to be a marionette, forced to dance
by the very strings of words that shackle you.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:05.960
In this world where all things
intertwine, transform and vanish,

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.830
the blazing flames, chaos itself...

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.380
--Wh-Why is this showing up onscreen?
--Of which this catastrophe, too,
is but a fragment...

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:17.620
In this uncertain world, there exists
but one thing that each life can control.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:20.290
And that is the ego as well as the self.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:23.620
Basophil, who are you speaking to?

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:26.830
We, who are but fragile life forms,

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:30.250
must affirm our reason for being
through independent actions,

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:34.670
and make our lives complete
by fulfilling our missions.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:39.460
"Follow the path you believe in."
Is that what you're saying?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:41.250
--We must never forget that our reason
for being is to prove our existence--

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.500
--Wh-What's this?
--We must never forget that our reason
for being is to prove our existence--

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.670
De-Dengue!

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.420
Dammit! What's taking
the Immune Cells so long?

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:59.330
I'm sure they'll be here soon,
so please stay calm!

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.170
But if they don't get here...

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.750
--De-Dengue!
--...we'll be toast!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.830
--De-Dengue! De-Dengue!
--I don't care who it is!

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:06.620
--Just save us!

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.040
--De-Dengue!
--Just save us!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.830
Is this histamine?

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:21.250
Was that you again, Mast Cell?

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.880
Just shut up, sit back and watch.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.040
Watch me work!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:30.380
Confirming histamine response.
Now dilating blood vessels.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.170
--Immune Cells, please head
to the site immediately.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.210
--Where are they?
--Immune Cells, please head
to the site immediately.

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:37.580
--Just you wait! Here we come!
--We're going to wipe them out
and then have a tea party!

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:39.540
--Come on out and show your faces!
--We're going to wipe them out
and then have a tea party!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.670
I'll kill you!

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:44.380
Target sighted!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.580
All of you, die!

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.330
You damn infected cells!

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:53.540
W-We're saved.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.170
De-Dengue!

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.040
Bye-bye, germ!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.830
Thank you very much!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.880
The crisis was averted in the nick of time.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:08.420
Thanks to the Immune Cells
who arrived on the scene...

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:12.750
...the virus was wiped out
without proliferating.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:16.500
The enemy was revealed
to be the dengue virus.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.670
This incident was triggered
by the invasion of the dengue virus

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:24.250
when the mosquito sucked blood from the body.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:28.210
They say it was a mosquito. Scary, huh?

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.080
We have to do some construction!

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.120
So, this crisis was caused
by a mosquito bite, huh?

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:38.420
Yeah. The cells we lost
won't be coming back.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:42.540
But we did manage to minimize the damage.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:45.710
Thanks to Mast Cell, that is.

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:51.250
It was because you released the histamines
that we were able to rush to the scene.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.170
Mast Cell...

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.500
Wh-What do you want?

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:00.920
Hey, I'm sorry.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:05.540
I didn't know that histamines
summoned the Immune Cells.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:09.290
Looks like it was you
who came to our rescue today.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.290
Hey you! Is it true that you
got tangled up in another incident?

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.170
Yes! I'm sorry!

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:18.080
Thanks, Mast Cell!

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:21.920
Sorry I called you hysterical, okay?

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:28.120
W-Well, I should've released
the histamines sooner.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:32.500
--Then, you wouldn't have had
to feel scared. So, I'm...
--Didn't I tell you to be careful?
I'm taking your hat from you!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.540
But that's so unfair!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.830
...sor--

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:41.750
Wait, I've been telling you from the start,
I've done nothing wrong!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:45.670
Why should I have to apologize, too?
That's so messed up!

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.620
Jeez, I was this close to apologizing!

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.120
We told you! The histamines make us so itchy!

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:50.670
"PLATELETS"
We told you! The histamines make us so itchy!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:53.250
"PLATELETS"
What do I care?

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:58.670
An irrational life causes a gust of wind
to blow, and all things transform.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.670
Did the wind break your umbrella?

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:04.330
--Yes.
--Why, you...

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:07.880
...public hazard cell!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.960
"ACNE"

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.790
This inflammatory response...

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.170
Hair root.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:29.210
The part of a hair embedded under the skin.
The tissue where hair is developed.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:35.290
Hey, stop slacking off!

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.620
Come on, make that sebum!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.710
--Anyone I find slacking
will get one hundred lashes!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:43.580
--I-I can't go on...
--Anyone I find slacking
will get one hundred lashes!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.380
Elder! Elder!

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:51.210
Aha! I spy a big-time slacker!

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.620
One hundred lashes--

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:58.330
L-Little boy, stop...

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.880
Hair Matrix Cell.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.120
Divides to produce hair.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:06.250
Don't you dare abuse the Elder!

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:12.830
All right, then are you ready to take
that old geezer's beating for him?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:16.540
Would that be a bit too cruel maybe?

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:19.750
Oh, but on second thought...

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.920
...a hundred lashes it is!

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:28.960
Die! You damn germ bastard!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.250
I'm White Blood Cell.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:38.210
I'm with the Neutrophil Division. Who are you?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:42.830
We are the cells who work in this pore.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.880
What in the world happened here?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.380
In the past, we all carried out
our own respective tasks,

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.830
like producing sebum or coloring.

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:56.460
But one day, the acne germs showed up
and began tyrannizing us!

00:13:56.460 --> 00:14:02.170
This is no longer a mere pore! It's a pimple!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:03.420
Pimple.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.920
An inflammatory disease of the skin.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:10.960
Inflammation begins when the pores
become clogged with sebum.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:14.420
The parts of the body that produce
excess sebum are susceptible to acne.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.880
An outbreak is often accompanied
by pus and some pain.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:20.540
What's this? What's all this commotion?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.710
It's the acne germs!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.120
Acne germ.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:28.290
Normal bacteria flora that can cause acne.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:32.540
Official name is "Propionibacterium acnes."

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:36.080
Dislikes oxygen and loves sebum.

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:40.120
Huh? Y-You damn White Blood Cell! How dare you!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.710
Acne germs? Just look at that horde!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:49.540
Big Brother White Blood Cell!
I'm going to help you fight!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.080
L-Little boy! Stop it!

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.170
Big Brother!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:04.040
--White Blood Cell!
--Little boy!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.580
There are no saviors here!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:10.290
Now get back to your posts and work!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:17.420
Where are we?

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.670
You came to?

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:22.000
Sorry about that! It's all my fault.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:28.120
No. You've done nothing wrong.
Anyway, who were those guys back there?

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:34.420
It all started with such a minor problem.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:38.330
The pipe we use to send sebum
to the epidermis got clogged with dirt...

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.330
...and the whole pore got flooded with sebum.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.580
That's when the sebum-loving acne germs
set their sights on us.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.920
And they just kept getting
stronger and stronger!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.040
The next thing we knew,
we'd been taken over...

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.880
...and they'd made us their slaves!

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:57.000
Why did you wait around
for them to multiply like that?

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.920
Didn't my friends come to save you?

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:03.790
Sure they did. But... But they just...

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.750
They gave up!

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.380
All of them!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.080
Look at that.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.710
Wh-What is that? Pus?

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:17.420
My friends' corpses?

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:23.080
They were all brave warriors just like you.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.620
But...

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.250
Just look at them now!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:33.790
This hair root is our homeland
as well as our precious workplace.

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:38.830
But in the overall scheme of things,
it's merely a single pore.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:43.040
All we have to do
is submit to being wiped out.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:46.830
Little boy, try to understand.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:49.080
I see.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:53.830
If only I had courage
just like you White Blood Cells!

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.170
This is No. 1146.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:05.580
I've spotted a den of acne germs
in that hair root.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.670
Requesting those nearby
to come to my aid.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.040
Gotcha! We'll be a little late!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.880
Huh? B-B-But...

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:14.460
No matter how small its impact...

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:19.040
...so long as a germ runs rampant
in this body, I can't let it go.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.920
That's my...

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:23.420
That's our job.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.580
Big Brother...

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:31.420
All right! A hundred lashes!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.420
Die!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:41.790
Ah, you're that White Blood Cell
who should've died then. You're still alive?

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.120
How amusing!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:49.580
I, the King of the Acne Germs, shall add you
to my collection of White Blood Cell corpses!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.750
You can take your place in that pus now!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:54.790
I'll kill you first!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.290
Be careful!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.540
Try not to fall!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:10.670
You can do it, Big Brother!

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:13.830
Die!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:20.500
I'm going to smash you to pieces!

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:25.210
Hey, look! He has a shot at winning!

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:26.670
Something's off.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:32.540
I'm sure you were too obese and slow
to defeat all those White Blood Cells.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:37.210
What kind of low methods did you stoop to,
Acne Germ King or whatever?

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:42.170
You have no clue yet
how terrifying I can be!

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:46.540
I'm going to give you a taste
of some interminable suffering!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.250
Just as I did your friends!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:51.210
What?

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:53.290
"MUAH"
Muah!

00:18:57.460 --> 00:19:01.460
How do you like that?
Talk about a geographical edge!

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:06.040
Here, we have an endless supply
of our favorite food, sebum!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:09.790
That's why we're able to heal over and over!

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.460
Th-This is bad!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.040
It was futile from the start.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:18.500
It was simply that man's fate to become pus.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.420
Let us resign ourselves.

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:24.210
After all, what is this but a single hair?

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:30.960
No matter how small its impact...

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.380
...so long as a germ runs
rampant in this body...

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.960
...I can't let it go.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:38.960
Elder...

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.500
Elder, you...

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:42.500
...dummy!

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:44.120
"POW"
...dummy!

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:47.540
L-Little boy! How dare you
do such a thing to the Elder!

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.620
Big Brother told me...

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.620
...that no matter how small its impact,
he'd still fight it!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.420
Because that was his job!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.670
It may be a single hair...

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:01.420
...but it's still our precious homeland!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:08.580
Big Brother and all the White Blood Cells
who died were fighting for a single hair!

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:11.960
So, how can we give up on it ourselves?

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:15.000
L-Little boy...

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.500
Elder, I'm sorry, but...

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.420
Elder...

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:22.750
Elder, we feel the same way.

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:24.620
Now is the time...

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.750
...for us to make a stand!

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.120
Y-You people...

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:36.000
Not bad! Who knew you'd hang on this long?
But it's all over now!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.000
Die!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.670
A resounding victory for me!

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:47.580
Now, let's get you into
my collection of corpses!

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:49.000
--Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:51.170
--What's that I hear?
--Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.580
Open it up all the way!

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:05.170
Turn it! Full throttle, now!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:09.120
--This is our workplace!
--And we're going to protect it ourselves!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.380
W-Water? No, this is...

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:15.290
...sebum?

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.920
Full blast! Keep turning
until it's open full blast!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:21.000
If it's sebum you want,
we'll give you sebum!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.880
Big Brother...

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:27.960
My belly's so heavy!
This is bad! I'm drowning!

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:31.210
I have to get away from here for now.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:35.620
You feasted too much on sebum, slowpoke!

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.540
Die, you miserable germ!

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:57.500
Sir White Blood Cell, please forgive us.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:59.330
Big Brother!

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:09.880
We don't know where that
White Blood Cell went after that.

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:11.250
Is that right?

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:14.620
Who knows what became of him?

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:21.290
We're going to search over there!

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:35.380
Did I fall into the sebum pipe?

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:37.500
I'm shiny all over!

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:39.120
Big Brother!

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:48.080
Big Brother!

00:22:49.540 --> 00:22:53.540
Thank you. This single hair
that you protected...

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:56.960
We'll always cherish it
and take good care of it.

00:22:56.960 --> 00:23:00.750
Until the day it falls out.

00:23:00.750 --> 00:23:05.170
I'm telling you, man,
you have to be kinder to yourself.

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:09.000
People who can't be kind to themselves
can't be kind to others.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:10.880
Yeah, I'll keep that in mind.

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:12.500
Hey, thanks.

00:23:14.500 --> 00:23:18.210
Hey! White... Blood... Cell?

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:23.620
Did you, uh, switch jobs?

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:26.420
No, I just... you know...

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:30.250
Big Brother, this is for you.

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:35.750
It's a token of my gratitude!

